A LINE THAT BEGINS WITH A RIGHT PARENTHESIS IS NOT APL BUT
A SYSTEM COMMAND: A WORD TO THE SYSTEM AROUND APL. TWO OF
THEM SAY WHERE YOU ARE. TRY:

      )DIALECT
      )WSID

THE FIRST ANSWERS (A) '70 OR (B) '75. SW-APL HAS TWO MODES,
ONE MODELLED ON THE APL OF 1970 AND ONE ON THE APL OF 1975.
THIS COURSE RUNS IN BOTH; LESSON 16 SAYS HOW THEY DIFFER.
THE SECOND ANSWERS COURSE, THE NAME OF THIS WORKSPACE: THE
FUNCTIONS AND VARIABLES YOU ARE WORKING WITH.
(TRY IT. TYPE GO TO GO ON, OR STOP TO LEAVE.)
⎕:
      )DIALECT
(A) '70
⎕:
      )WSID
COURSE
⎕:
